{
  "name": "sdk-config-output-format-stop",
  "about": "sdkSessionConfig.outputFormat（json_schema）让循环在拿到结构化输出后立刻收尾（src/cli/SessionAgentConfigBundle.ts:140 outputFormat → stopOnStructuredOutput:true；src/agent/loop/AgentLoop.ts:2192-2207：工具批执行完、structuredOutput 已有值时不再请求模型，发 agent_status:structured_output_completed（3793-3805），轮次以 completed 结束，投影先发 structured_output 事件再发 turn_completed，GatewayAgentEventProjector.ts:563-567）。o1：模型调 structured_output 后本该再请求一次，这里不会；o2：同一会话没有 outputFormat 时照常再请求一次。",
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\":\"Format\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "o2-after",
      "when": [
        "o2:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_o2\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Second request happened."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "o2",
      "when": [
        "o2:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_o2",
          "name": "structured_output",
          "arguments": {
            "value": {
              "answer": 2
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "o1-after",
      "when": [
        "o1:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_o1\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Should not be requested."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "o1",
      "when": [
        "o1:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_o1",
          "name": "structured_output",
          "arguments": {
            "value": {
              "answer": 42,
              "items": [
                "a",
                "b"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-fmt",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "o1: answer in json",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "outputFormat": {
            "type": "json_schema",
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "answer": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "answer"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-plain",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "o2: answer in json"
      },
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "read_session_messages",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-fmt"
      }
    }
  ]
}
